# Receptive (drag and drop) and Hidden (fullscreen) overlays (PS §3.3, §6.4).

scenario: accepted drag opens receptive, then returns
start media
drag-enter                          -> Receptive
drag-leave                          -> Compact
drag-enter
drop                                -> Compact

scenario: rejected drag is ignored
drag-rejected                       -> Idle

scenario: drag wins over expanded, which resumes after
start media
click
drag-enter                          -> Receptive
drag-leave                          -> Expanded

scenario: drag replays the interrupted alert afterwards
alert copied                        -> Alert
drag-enter                          -> Receptive queue=1
drag-leave                          -> Alert alert=copied

scenario: hidden drops active alerts and holds urgent ones
start media
alert song                          -> Alert
hide                                -> Hidden queue=0
alert ignored                       -> Hidden queue=0
alert meeting timeSensitive         -> Hidden queue=1
show                                -> Alert alert=meeting

scenario: held alerts expire after 30 s
hide
alert meeting timeSensitive         -> queue=1
wait 30001                          -> Hidden queue=0
show                                -> Idle

scenario: hiding collapses expanded
start media
click                               -> Expanded
hide                                -> Hidden
show                                -> Compact
